  "document": "Jeremy Theobald\nJeremy Theobald is a British actor best known for his portrayal of \"The Young Man\", the main character in Christopher Nolan's 1998 major picture debut \"Following\", and for which Theobald was also a producer, Filming was scheduled around their day jobs. Jonathan Romney, writing in the \"New Statesman\", noted that \"Nolan and his cast are terrific finds: I wouldn't normally say this to struggling artists, but they might want to give up their day jobs.\""
